; validatesave.eval - running the checker must not change what a save writes
; (editor-updates P0).
;
; The defect this pins: Validate reached every other level through the EDIT
; stash (EnsureMapStash), and a stashed level is one savemap rewrites. So a
; press of Check made the next save rewrite every level in the project,
; untouched ones included. `savemap` names each level it wrote; after a
; validate that list must be the active level alone.
;
; Writes level files. tools/EditorTest.py backs the project up and restores it.

logecho on
reset
validate
savemap
